<title>UK: RHEINBODEN HYPO SETS 150 MLN MARK DEC 2001 BOND.</title>
<headline>RHEINBODEN HYPO SETS 150 MLN MARK DEC 2001 BOND.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Sal Oppenheim Frankfurt.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RHEINBODEN HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN DEM   COUPON  ** 4.0	 MATURITY ** 19.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.90    PAY DATE   S25.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 LISTING    DUES	PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) 1	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.75	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
